<h1>Terms of use</h1>
<p class="lead">By using VisionConnect Jobs you agree to these simple rules.</p>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="t1"><h2 id="t1">For everyone</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Give true information. Do not pretend to be someone else.</li>
    <li>Keep your password private. You are responsible for what happens in your account.</li>
    <li>Do not post anything illegal, abusive, or misleading, and do not misuse other people’s details.</li>
</ul></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="t2"><h2 id="t2">For employers</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Post only real jobs. Never ask job seekers for money, deposits or fees.</li>
    <li>Use candidates’ personal and disability details only to assess and support their application.</li>
    <li>We check jobs before they go live and can reject or remove a job or account that breaks these rules.</li>
</ul></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="t3"><h2 id="t3">For job seekers</h2>
<ul>
    <li>VisionConnect connects you with employers. We cannot promise a job or an interview.</li>
    <li>Never pay money to get a job. If an employer asks, please tell us.</li>
</ul></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="t4"><h2 id="t4">Our service</h2>
<p>We work to keep the site available and accessible, but we do not guarantee it will always be error free or online. We may update these terms; the latest version is always on this page.</p></section>
<p>See also the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
